# Git remotes and GitHub MCP creds

| | |
| --- | --- |
| Remotes | Prefer `interchouette` then `github` (see global Cursor git-remote rule) |
| Creds file | Repo-local **`.github`** (gitignored) with `GITHUB_TOKEN=…`, or set `GITHUB_CREDS_FILE` |
| MCP launcher | `scripts/github-mcp.sh` (reads creds file; no host-absolute path defaults) |

Do not commit `.github` or put machine-local absolute paths in this rule or in MCP config.
